88b64fbe-0c55-4936-8d6e-307d72d18390	REFUND_POLICY	Refund Policy	\N	Refund Policy\n\nRefunds are available in the following circumstances:<br><br>\nIf products have quality issues, such as:<br>\nChocolate products that have melted during delivery<br>\nCoffee packages that arrive damaged or opened<br>\nIf the package is returned to AL KHADRA ROASTERIES unopened and in its original condition.<br>	\N	2025-05-21 06:37:06.679	{}	2025-05-20 12:03:28.498	2025-05-21 06:37:06.681
f6463211-0a33-4f0e-8922-f2e4808ac078	PRIVACY_POLICY	Privacy Policy	\N	1. Overview This Privacy Policy explains how Green Roasteries ("we," "us," or "our") collects, uses, discloses, and safeguards your information when you visit our website www.greenroasteries.com (the "Website") or make a purchase from us.<br><br>\n\n  <h2><strong>Please read this Privacy Policy carefully.  </strong></h2>By accessing or using our Website, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by all the terms outlined in this policy.<br><br>\n\n  <h2><strong>2. Information We Collect We may collect personal information that you voluntarily provide to us when you:  </strong></h2><br>\n\nRegister on our Website Place an order Subscribe to our newsletter Participate in surveys or contests Contact our customer service team The personal information we collect may include:<br><br>\n\nName Email address Mailing address Phone number Payment information (we do not store complete credit card information) Additionally, we automatically collect certain information about your device when you visit our Website, including:<br><br>\n\nIP address Browser type Operating system Pages visited Time and date of your visit Referring website <br><br>\n\n  <h2><strong>3. How We Use Your Information We may use the information we collect for various purposes, including to:  </strong></h2><br>\n\nProcess and fulfill your orders Provide customer support Send you promotional emails about new products, special offers, or other information we think you may find interesting Improve our Website and customer service Administer contests, promotions, surveys, or other site features Analyze usage patterns to enhance user experience Prevent fraudulent transactions and monitor against theft<br><br>\n\n <h2><strong>4. Cookies and Tracking Technologies </strong></h2> We use cookies and similar tracking technologies to track activity on our Website and store certain information. Cookies are files with a small amount of data which may include an anonymous unique identifier. You can instruct your browser to refuse all cookies or to indicate when a cookie is being sent.<br><br>\n\n <h2><strong>5. Third-Party Disclosure We may share your personal information with:</strong></h2> <br>\n\nService providers who help us operate our business and Website (e.g., payment processors, shipping companies) Marketing partners with whom we have joint marketing agreements Legal authorities when required by law or to protect our legal rights We do not sell, trade, or otherwise transfer your personally identifiable information to outside parties except as described above.<br><br>\n\n <h2><strong>6. Data Security We implement a variety of security measures to maintain the safety of your personal information. Your personal information is contained behind secured networks and is only accessible by a limited number of persons who have special access rights to such systems, and are required to keep the information confidential.</strong></h2><br><br>\n\n <h2><strong>7. Your Rights Depending on your location, you may have certain rights regarding your personal information, including:</strong></h2><br>\n\nThe right to access personal information we hold about you The right to request correction of inaccurate information The right to request deletion of your information The right to opt-out of marketing communications To exercise these rights, please contact us using the information provided in the "Contact Us" section below.<br><br>\n\n <h2><strong>8. Children's Privacy Our Website is not intended for individuals under the age of 18.</strong></h2> We do not knowingly collect or solicit personal information from children. If you are a parent or guardian and believe that your child has provided us with personal information, please contact us.<br><br>\n\n <h2><strong>9. Changes to this Privacy Policy We reserve the right to modify this Privacy Policy at any time.</strong></h2> Changes will be effective immediately upon posting to the Website. We encourage you to periodically review this page for the latest information on our privacy practices.<br><br>\n\n <h2><strong>10. Contact Us </strong></h2> If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:<br><br>\n\nEmail: info@thegreenroasteries.com Phone: +971 (50) 123-4567 Address: 123 Coffee St, Brewing District, Dubai, UAE	\N	2025-05-21 06:47:03.789	{}	2025-05-20 12:02:58.756	2025-05-21 06:47:03.79
cb27007e-573b-4dd2-a047-dddb36233487	TERMS_CONDITIONS	Terms & Conditions	\N	\n\n  <h1><strong>Shipping & Refund Policy</strong></h1>\n  <p><strong>The Green Roasteries</strong>, operated by <strong>AL KHADRA ROASTERIES LLC</strong>, is committed to delivering our products across the UAE with care and efficiency.</p><br>\n\n  <section>\n    <h2><strong>Processing Time</strong></h2>\n    <ul>\n      <li>All orders are processed within 1–3 business days.</li>\n      <li>No processing or deliveries are made on Fridays or UAE public holidays.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </section><br>\n\n  <section>\n    <h2><strong>Daily Cut-Off Time</strong></h2>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Orders placed before <strong>12:00 AM Dubai Time</strong> are processed on the same business day.</li>\n      <li>Orders placed after this time or on holidays will be processed the next business day.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </section><br>\n\n  <section>\n    <h2><strong>Delivery Fees</strong></h2>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Free delivery</strong> on orders of 200 AED or more.</li>\n      <li><strong>15 AED shipping fee</strong> applies to orders under 200 AED (non-refundable in case of cancellation).</li>\n    </ul>\n  </section><br>\n\n  <section>\n    <h2><strong>Delivery Requirements</strong></h2>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Please provide a complete and accurate delivery address.</li>\n      <li>Include correct contact details to prevent delays in delivery.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </section><br>\n\n  <section>\n    <h2><strong>Customs and Taxes</strong></h2>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Domestic UAE orders are generally not subject to customs or taxes.</li>\n      <li>Any applicable regional fees or surcharges are the responsibility of the customer.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </section><br>\n\n  <section>\n    <h2><strong>Refund Policy</strong></h2>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Refunds are available in the following situations:\n        <ul>\n          <li>Chocolate products that melt during delivery.</li>\n          <li>Coffee packages that arrive damaged or opened.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li>The item must be returned unopened and in its original condition to qualify for a refund.</li>\n      <li>The 15 AED shipping fee (for orders under 200 AED) is non-refundable upon cancellation.</li>\n      <li>For any refund request, please contact our customer service team with your order details.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </section><br>\n\n  <section>\n    <p>For any questions or assistance regarding our shipping or refund policy, please contact our customer service at <strong>[contact information]</strong>.</p>\n    <p>Thank you for choosing <strong>The Green Roasteries</strong>!</p>\n  </section>\n\n	\N	2025-05-20 12:18:10.116	{}	2025-05-20 12:01:57.71	2025-05-20 12:18:10.118
2e123670-d14e-498a-aee7-dc61472bb690	ABOUT_US	Our Story	\N	<h2><strong>Our story began from our love of coffee!</strong></h2><br>\n<p>We import the best coffee beans in the world & roast it carefully, We offer you an experience and\nquality products that are made with love..For our coffee lovrs.</p><br>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Chosen with care, roasted with love</li>\n  <li>We strive for your ultimate o happiness in trying our crops and making it an unforgettable\nexperience.</li>\n  <li>From here begins the journey to the peak of your mood</li>\n</ul>	\N	2025-05-21 07:04:33.174	{"heroImage": "/images/coffee-beans-bg.jpg", "heroTitle": "Our Story", "heroTagline": "From bean to cup, our passion fuels every step of the journey.", "heroTitleAr": "", "contentImage": "/images/coffee-roasting-process.jpg", "heroTaglineAr": ""}	2025-05-21 06:14:47.757	2025-05-21 07:04:33.176
